{"channelId":"UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","row":["VetCare Canada",71,"👋Nice to meet you! We’re VetCare. Our Canada-wide community of veterinary practices is taking a new approach to vet med. How? By blending the personal touch of private practice with the support and resources of a greater collective.\n\nWhile our veterinary professionals swap notes, expand their skills, and give a personalized spectrum of care to every pet, our business side handles the boring behind-the-scenes stuff like hiring, payroll and other admin duties.\n\nThat’s why we’re here — to make sure everything runs smoothly so our talented DVMs, RVTs, VTs and other team members can focus on what matters: the medicine. Sound good? Then let's get started.🍁♥️","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:48.838Z","channelId":"UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"be81b459bf6cff89b7a54bfce4c8a2b6a325e6839e9e216434a483486f27afd7","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5ce341ef64fc07397e6d1eb7676ff034289caea69fb1a4dcccd940f1b8d2fa3c"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":71,"raw":"71 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:48.838Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://vet-care.ca/contact-us/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:40:51.307Z"}],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-TRqb7LOKXYI3iy76Uiqig"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群